<title>USA: Omaha hogs up off $0.25 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs up off $0.25 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.25 lower. Top $59.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   230-250 lbs few opened 59.50</p>
<p>Sows - not established.</p>
</text>
